      "writtenOn": "2026-03-12T23:47:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We very likely do have issues like this, which is why I\u0027m keen to remove these checks from `CanGenerate()`. It makes a lot more sense to me to put the checks next to (or in) the code that they are protecting. Making `CanGenerate()` do more complicated checks here feels unappealing when we already have the information we want to check in the transform that consumes it.\n\nSee https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/283697 for another example where we moved validation from `CanGenerate()` to the relevant transform, to avoid duplicating logic between the two places.\n\nCan you explain your concern about `Print()`? By the time we get to `Print()` there is exactly one entry point, so there shouldn\u0027t be any problems there?",
